Usage: {{project-name}} text [options] [command]

Text transformations over the textkit core.

Options:
  --format <format>             Output format for data commands: plain or json.
                                (default: "plain")
  --json                        Shorthand for --format json.
  --no-color                    Disable colour in diagnostics (NO_COLOR is also
                                honoured).
  --verbose                     Print diagnostics about what the command is
                                doing.
  --quiet                       Suppress diagnostics.
  --no-input                    Never prompt; fail instead of asking.
  --dry-run                     Show what would happen without writing anything.
  -h, --help                    display help for command

Commands:
  slugify [options] <text...>   Convert text to a lowercase hyphenated slug.
  truncate [options] <text...>  Shorten text to at most --max characters.
  help [command]                display help for command
